<title>PORTUGAL: Yld flat on Bank/Portugal 4-week drain offer.</title>
<headline>Yld flat on Bank/Portugal 4-week drain offer.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said that it drained six billion escudos of four-week funds at 6.2433 percent, against 6.2467 percent previously.</p>
<p>It accepted no bids for the draining of nine-week funds.</p>
<p>The last draining operation was on February 19.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
